## 2. What was Continued and Finished

1. **`argoFleetService.js` Resiliency & Metadata:**
   - Raised the network timeout to **`15000ms`** (up from 6000ms) to ensure international connection latency never causes accidental fallbacks.
   - Tagged floats with `isRealTime: true` and `dataSource: 'IFREMER ERDDAP (Live)'`.
   - Exposed `window.argoFleetStatus` and dispatched the `argoFleetLoaded` custom event.

2. **Top-Right HUD Real-Time Indicator:**
   - Added a live indicator pill at the top-right: `🟢 LIVE ERDDAP (30 Floats)`.
   - Added a live badge in the Stations Network sidebar: `● REAL-TIME`.
   - Both automatically reflect live vs. fallback status dynamically.

3. **Temperature Color Schema Toggle:**
   - Created the `toggleTemperatureMode()` JavaScript function in [index.html](file:///c:/Users/siddh/Desktop/SIHProject/MainProjectFiles/index.html).
   - Wired to `window.applyTemperatureColors(isActive)`.
   - When active, beacons and stems dynamically recolor:
     - 🔴 **Warm Red** (`#ff4d4d`) for surface temperatures `> 28°C`
     - 🔵 **Cool Cyan** (`#00f0ff`) for surface temperatures `≤ 28°C`
   - Preserves green highlight (`#00ff66`) on whichever station is currently selected.

4. **Integration with `oceanDataService.js`:**
   - Updated baseline calculation in `ProceduralArgoProvider` to directly preserve and display real live ERDDAP surface temperature and salinity in the slide-out inspection panel and CTD table.

5. **Raycast Click Filtering:**
   - Updated `onPointerClick` in [World.js](file:///c:/Users/siddh/Desktop/SIHProject/MainProjectFiles/3d%20pages/World.js) to ignore clicks on `.top-right-bar`, `.temp-toggle-container`, and `.argo-live-pill`, preventing accidental globe selections when interacting with controls.

6. **Real-Time Ocean SST Thermal Heatmap Layer on Globe (Matching Image):**
   - Created a dynamic high-resolution ($2048 \times 1024$) spherical ocean thermal layer (`sstMesh`) on the 3D globe at radius `GLOBE_RADIUS * 1.0022`.
   - **Real-Time Spatial Interpolation:** Uses Inverse Distance Weighting (IDW) interpolation directly across the live ERDDAP floats (all 153 active basin floats in the North Indian Ocean).
   - **Authentic Satellite Thermal Palette:**
     - $T \ge 29.5^\circ\text{C}$: Deep Burgundy / Crimson-Maroon (`#781230` to `#e11d48`)
     - $28.5 \le T < 29.5^\circ\text{C}$: Flame Orange to Red (`#f97316` to `#e11d48`)
     - $27.8 \le T < 28.5^\circ\text{C}$: Golden Amber / Yellow (`#eab308`)
     - $27.0 \le T < 27.8^\circ\text{C}$: Vibrant Sea Green (`#22c55e`)
     - $T < 27.0^\circ\text{C}$: Cool Cyan / Deep Teal (`#06b6d4` to `#0e7490`)
   - **Precise Land Mask:** Protects the Indian subcontinent and Sri Lanka using geographic boundary curves (`isIndianOceanWater(lat, lon)`), ensuring the thermal heat field only colors the sea, matching the user's reference image.
   - **HUD Thermal Color Scale Legend:** Added a glassmorphic color gradient scale bar (`#sstLegendPanel`) from `26°C` to `31°C+` that slides in when Temperature mode is active.

